          "style": "p { text-align: center; }",
          "body": "\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background-color:#ffffff;font-family:&#39;Barlow&#39;,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">\n  <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:čėpx 36px 0 36px;text-align:center;\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#bfa61f;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;text-align:center;\"></p>\n    <h1 style=\"margin:0;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:32px;line-height:1.12;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.02em;text-align:center;\">Paruošiau tau 11% nuolaidą</h1>\n    <p style=\"margin:16px 0 0 0;color:#4a4a4a;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;font-weight:500;text-align:center;\">\n      Tai paskutinis mano priminimas apie tavo paliktą krepšelį. Paruošiau tau 11% nuolaidą, kad galėtum užbaigti pirkimą paprasčiau! :)\n    </p>\n  </td></tr>\n  \n  \n  <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 36px 0 36px;text-align:center;\">\n    <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#fbf8ec;border:2px dashed #fbcd0a;border-radius:14px;\">\n      <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:22px;text-align:center;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0;color:#1a1a1a;font-size:38px;line-height:1;font-weight:900;\">-11% nuolaida</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:8px 0 0 0;color:#8a7a3a;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;\">Tavo asmeninis kodas žemiau</p>\n      </td></tr>\n    </table>\n\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>"
